        <hr class="my-8 border-gray-200" />
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-900">2. Nature of the Platform</h2>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2 text-gray-900">2.1 Technology Platform Only</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">BreederHQ is a technology platform that provides tools and infrastructure enabling animal breeders and animal-service professionals ("Providers") to manage their operations and connect with potential buyers ("Buyers"). <strong>BreederHQ is not a party to any transaction between Providers and Buyers.</strong></p>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2 text-gray-900">2.2 No Agency or Brokerage</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">BreederHQ:</p>
        <ul class="mb-4 ml-6 list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700"><li>Does NOT sell animals or services;</li><li>Does NOT act as a broker or intermediary in transactions, and acts as an agent only as expressly provided in §2.7 (Limited Payments Agent);</li><li>Does NOT provide escrow services;</li><li>Does NOT act as an escrow agent and does NOT hold any User's funds in trust or as a fiduciary; payment processing and settlement are handled by a third-party payment processor as described in the Marketplace Transaction Terms;</li><li>Does NOT guarantee, warrant, or certify any animals, services, or transactions;</li><li>Does NOT verify, endorse, or take responsibility for Provider listings, claims, or representations, except as expressly limited by §2.5 (Third-Party Registry Passthrough) and §2.6 (Third-Party Identity Verification Passthrough);</li><li>Does NOT evaluate, validate, or warrant the authenticity, currency, or contents of any document any Provider uploads through the Services, regardless of whether such document is displayed publicly or linked from a Provider listing; and</li><li>Does NOT broker, recommend, evaluate, hold, escrow, verify, or facilitate any insurance coverage of any Provider; the maintenance of any insurance coverage by a Provider is solely the Provider's independent legal responsibility under applicable law.</li></ul>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2 text-gray-900">2.3 Direct Party Transactions</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">All transactions conducted through or in connection with the Services are directly between the Provider and the Buyer. BreederHQ provides the technological infrastructure for the Services, including listing management, communication, and, where §2.7 applies, limited payment collection as the Provider's agent.</p>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2 text-gray-900">2.4 Meaning of "Verification" on the Services</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Except as expressly stated in a Third-Party Registry Passthrough display under §2.5 or a Third-Party Identity Verification Passthrough display under §2.6, BreederHQ does not "verify," "vet," "certify," "endorse," "screen," "approve," "validate," or "warrant" any Provider, Provider claim, Provider credential, Provider document, or animal listed on the Services. Where the Services display any badge, indicator, or descriptor concerning a Provider, the display reflects (a) facts about the Provider's account history on the Services (such as date of account creation, response time to Buyer inquiries, dispute history), (b) the Provider's own representations and uploaded materials, (c) a Third-Party Identity Verification Passthrough as defined in §2.6, or (d) a Third-Party Registry Passthrough as defined in §2.5. <strong>No such badge, indicator, or descriptor constitutes BreederHQ's evaluation, endorsement, or warranty of the Provider's identity (except as confirmed by a Third-Party Identity Verification Provider under §2.6), competence, fitness, qualifications, character, professional credentials, insurance status, licensing status, or the accuracy or authenticity of any Provider-uploaded document.</strong></p>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2 text-gray-900">2.5 Third-Party Registry Passthrough</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Where a public third-party registry operated by an issuing body (such as the American Farrier's Association, American Kennel Club, Orthopedic Foundation for Animals, or a state veterinary licensing board) maintains a publicly searchable record and returns a matching record for a Provider's Credential Attestation, BreederHQ may display an indicator labeled "Confirmed via [registry name] registry" together with a hyperlink to the source record and a timestamp showing the date of BreederHQ's query. Such display means only that, as of the timestamp shown adjacent to the indicator, the named registry returned a matching record in response to BreederHQ's query. <strong>BreederHQ does not undertake any duty to monitor the named registry for subsequent changes, withdrawals, expirations, or amendments. The consumer is directed to follow the hyperlink to the registry's source record as the authoritative source.</strong> If BreederHQ ceases to display a passthrough indicator, no inference is to be drawn as to the Provider's standing with the registry.</p>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2 text-gray-900">2.6 Third-Party Identity Verification Passthrough</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Where a Third-Party Identity Verification Provider (as of the effective date of these Terms, Stripe Identity, operated by Stripe, Inc.) returns a successful identity verification for a User, BreederHQ may display an indicator labeled "Identity confirmed via [provider name]" together with the date of the verification. Such display means only that, as of the date shown, the named Third-Party Identity Verification Provider returned a successful verification in response to BreederHQ's request. <strong>The identity verification is performed by the Third-Party Identity Verification Provider in accordance with that provider's procedures, terms, and applicable law; BreederHQ does not itself perform the identity verification.</strong> BreederHQ does not undertake any duty to monitor the Third-Party Identity Verification Provider for subsequent changes to the User's identity-verification status. If BreederHQ ceases to display an identity-verification passthrough indicator, no inference is to be drawn as to the User's standing with the Third-Party Identity Verification Provider.</p>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2 text-gray-900">2.7 Limited Payments Agent</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">To the extent any payment is routed through BreederHQ's payment infrastructure, each Provider appoints BreederHQ as its limited agent solely for the purpose of receiving and settling amounts paid by Buyers for that Provider's transactions.</p>
