        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">BreederHQ's sole obligation with respect to amounts routed through its payment infrastructure is to settle them to the Provider in accordance with these Terms, net of amounts recoverable under §6.4 of the Marketplace Transaction Terms, and the Provider's exclusive remedy for a failure to settle is payment of the unsettled amount.</p>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">BreederHQ's role as limited payments agent is solely that of the Provider's payment collection agent; it does not make BreederHQ a party to any transaction and does not create any fiduciary, trust, or escrow relationship beyond that limited agency.</p>
        <hr class="my-8 border-gray-200" />
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-900">3. User Responsibilities</h2>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2 text-gray-900">3.1 Provider Responsibilities</h3>
