        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">BreederHQ does not open, read, validate, compare, evaluate, or vouch for any uploaded document. Display of an uploaded document or a link to it on the Services is not a representation by BreederHQ as to the document's authenticity, currency, or content. A Provider's false attestation under this section constitutes a material breach of the User Agreement and a violation of the Acceptable Use Policy.</p>
