        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><strong>(c) What this cap does not limit.</strong> Subsections (a) and (b) do not apply to BreederHQ's liability for: (i) fraud or fraudulent misrepresentation; (ii) willful misconduct or gross negligence; (iii) death or personal injury caused by BreederHQ's negligence; (iv) BreederHQ's obligation under §2.7 to pay over amounts it has actually collected on a Provider's behalf and not settled, net of any amounts properly recoverable under §2.7 and §6.4 of the Marketplace Transaction Terms, provided that this subsection preserves recovery of those amounts in full and does not expand the exclusive remedy stated in §2.7; (v) BreederHQ's obligation to refund amounts charged to you in error; or (vi) any other liability that cannot lawfully be excluded or limited under applicable law.</p>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><strong>(d) Consumer rights preserved.</strong> Nothing in this Section limits, waives, or otherwise affects any right or remedy that, under applicable law, cannot be waived as a condition of using a consumer service, including any right described in §10.5 (State-Specific Provisions). If any part of this Section is held unenforceable as to a particular claim or claimant, that part shall be severed as to that claim or claimant and the remainder of this Section shall continue in full force and effect.</p>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><strong>(e) Basis of the bargain.</strong> For Providers, the fees charged for the Services reflect the allocation of risk in this Section. For Buyers and other users who access the Services, in whole or in part, at no charge, that access is made available in reliance on this allocation of risk. BreederHQ would not provide the Services on these terms without it.</p>
