        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-900">7A. AI-Powered Features</h2>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2 text-gray-900">7A.1 AI Assistant and Scout AI</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">The Services include optional AI-powered features ("AI Features"), including the AI Assistant and Scout AI, that use third-party artificial intelligence technology to answer questions about your data and the platform. AI Features are available to users with eligible subscription plans and require explicit consent before first use.</p>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2 text-gray-900">7A.2 Data Processing Disclosure</h3>
