        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2 text-gray-900">7B.1 No Auto-Publishing to Third-Party Platforms</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">The Services include features that generate platform-tuned text and image content the Provider may copy and paste to their own third-party social media accounts, including but not limited to Facebook and Instagram (collectively, "Third-Party Platforms"). <strong>BreederHQ does not log into, authenticate against, store credentials for, or publish on the Provider's behalf to any Third-Party Platform.</strong> Any post that appears on a Third-Party Platform was placed there by the Provider through manual copy-and-paste action on their own account.</p>
